  "description": "Brotli (RFC 7932) compression and decompression for .NET in pure managed C#: no native libraries, no P/Invoke, no dependencies on .NET 10. Runs on Blazor WebAssembly, Native AOT, Unity and everywhere else managed code runs. Full-format decoder plus the Large Window extension, raw prefix dictionaries, output and window limits, detailed error reporting, an encoder with qualities 0-11, streaming with flush, concatenable fragments, multi-threaded compression, and a BrotliStream shaped like System.IO.Compression.",
